{"seq":1,"at":"2026-09-17","kind":"imported","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0378"},"reason":"Article of the Quiztopia bank (written for card c032): researched and transcribed in September 2026, converted to the quiz platform on 2026-10-20.","by":"Quiztopia import","ref":"quiz-archive/transcripts/quiztopia/c032.json"},
{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0378"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge history/contemporary","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/history__contemporary.g1.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",80],["-","Five"],["+","Six"],["=",537],["+","state's own products were named with the same patriotic logic. From 1959 the synthetic polyamide fibres made in the GDR, the Eastern answer to the West German Perlon, were sold under the trade name Dederon, a name built from the state's initials \"DDR\" with the ending \"-on\" borrowed from Perlon and nylon. Dederon shopping bags and the colourful synthetic housecoats known as Kittelschürzen were in every household, and the word became so closely tied to the country that it now sounds like the GDR itself.\n\nThe "],["=",442],["+","Dederon | official | GDR polyamide fibre |\n| "],["=",83]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",70],["-","Fünf"],["+","Sechs"],["=",489],["+","Auch die eigenen Produkte wurden nach derselben patriotischen Logik benannt. Ab 1959 kamen die in der DDR hergestellten Polyamidfasern, die östliche Antwort auf das westdeutsche Perlon, unter dem Handelsnamen Dederon in den Handel, ein Name aus den Initialen des Staates „DDR“ und der von Perlon und Nylon entlehnten Endung „-on“. Dederon-Einkaufsbeutel und die bunten Kittelschürzen aus Kunstfaser gab es in jedem Haushalt, und das Wort ist so eng mit dem Land verbunden, dass es heute wie die DDR selbst klingt.\n\n"],["=",394],["+","Dederon | offiziell | Polyamidfaser der DDR |\n| "],["=",81]]}]},
